<title>USA: UNC Inc gets $102 mln Army contract.</title>
<headline>UNC Inc gets $102 mln Army contract.</headline>
<dateline>ANNAPOLIS, Md. 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>UNC Inc, an aviation services company, said Tuesday it has received a $102 million contract to continue to train all U.S. Army, U.S. Navy and foreign military helicopter pilots at a training center at Ft. Rucker, Ala.</p>
<p>The contract, which was awarded by the U.S. Army, is for one year with four option years.</p>
